trust the most in the world.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.166
The end.

00:18:20.166 --> 00:18:23.875
When Travis was expanding Uber,
he either went to the market

00:18:23.875 --> 00:18:25.375
or Ryan Graves
went to the market

00:18:25.375 --> 00:18:26.625
'cause he trusted him the most.

00:18:26.625 --> 00:18:27.500
- [Josef] Okay.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.458
