move one of 'em there.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.041
- [Josef] Nice.

00:19:21.041 --> 00:19:22.667
- If you're only in one market,

00:19:22.667 --> 00:19:25.917
I'd probably move
to the second market.

00:19:25.917 --> 00:19:27.625
- [Josef] Thanks.
- You got it.

