- [Nicholas] The problem
of scheduling meetings,

00:19:50.625 --> 00:19:52.708
but more like for
businesses 'cause for example,

00:19:52.708 --> 00:19:53.667
I'm a consultant.

00:19:53.667 --> 00:19:54.500
- Yes.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.959
- [Nicholas] And if I
